of"},{"$id":"2767","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"Guid","FullInfo":"Guid","InfoMap":{"$id":"2768","FullIdObj":{"$id":"2769","$type":"IdentificableTypeSystem","Name":"Guid","FullInfo":"Guid","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"2769"},"Children":[],"Name":"SimpleSystemTypeNode","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"2466"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"Line":81,"CharPositionInLine":33,"_text":"Guid","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Guid"}],"Name":"CommandPropertyType","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"2466"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[]}],"Name":"PropertyTree","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"2466"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[]}]}],"Name":"Output declaration commands","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"2466"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[]}],"Name":"CommandDeclaration","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"2466"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[]},{"$id":"2770","$type":"DslCommandDeclarationTree","HasInput":true,"Children":[{"$id":"2771","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"COMMAND","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"2466"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"COMMAND","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"COMMAND"},{"$id":"2772","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"UpdateOrder","FullInfo":"Siemens.SimaticIT.UAPI.OperationalData.PIOrder_OP.OPModel.Commands.UpdateOrder","InfoMap":{"$id":"2773","FullIdObj":{"$id":"2774","$type":"IdentificableObject","Guid":"756982b4-ae7c-4678-b6dc-8b74dd03e61e","Name":"UpdateOrder","FullInfo":"Siemens.SimaticIT.UAPI.OperationalData.PIOrder_OP.OPModel.Commands.UpdateOrder","TypeResolved":"","_project":{"$ref":"12"},"_domain":{"$ref":"2469"}}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"2774"},"Children":[],"Name":"CommandName","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"2466"},"Documentation":{"$id":"2775","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"Updates an Order.\r\nWhen the Order is updated, the command raises the OrderUpdated event.\r\nThe command checks the Order:\r\n1. if it exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n2. if the Quantity is not < 0, if so error 10849 is returned;\r\n3. if the UoM is defined but not the Quantity, if not error 10008 is returned;\r\n4. if the ActualStartTime >= ActualEndTime, if not error 10979 is returned;\r\n5. if PlannedStartTime >= PlannedEndTime, if not error 11201 is returned;\r\n6. if the StateMachine exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n7. if the StateMachine has at least one Status, if not error 11320 is returned;\r\n8. if the StateMachine has an initial Status, if not the error 10984 is returned.","FullInfo":"Updates an Order.\r\nWhen the Order is updated, the command raises the OrderUpdated event.\r\nThe command checks the Order:\r\n1. if it exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n2. if the Quantity is not < 0, if so error 10849 is returned;\r\n3. if the UoM is defined but not the Quantity, if not error 10008 is returned;\r\n4. if the ActualStartTime >= ActualEndTime, if not error 10979 is returned;\r\n5. if PlannedStartTime >= PlannedEndTime, if not error 11201 is returned;\r\n6. if the StateMachine exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n7. if the StateMachine has at least one Status, if not error 11320 is returned;\r\n8. if the StateMachine has an initial Status, if not the error 10984 is returned.","InfoMap":{"$id":"2776","FullIdObj":{"$id":"2777","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Updates an Order.\r\nWhen the Order is updated, the command raises the OrderUpdated event.\r\nThe command checks the Order:\r\n1. if it exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n2. if the Quantity is not < 0, if so error 10849 is returned;\r\n3. if the UoM is defined but not the Quantity, if not error 10008 is returned;\r\n4. if the ActualStartTime >= ActualEndTime, if not error 10979 is returned;\r\n5. if PlannedStartTime >= PlannedEndTime, if not error 11201 is returned;\r\n6. if the StateMachine exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n7. if the StateMachine has at least one Status, if not error 11320 is returned;\r\n8. if the StateMachine has an initial Status, if not the error 10984 is returned.","FullInfo":"Updates an Order.\r\nWhen the Order is updated, the command raises the OrderUpdated event.\r\nThe command checks the Order:\r\n1. if it exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n2. if the Quantity is not < 0, if so error 10849 is returned;\r\n3. if the UoM is defined but not the Quantity, if not error 10008 is returned;\r\n4. if the ActualStartTime >= ActualEndTime, if not error 10979 is returned;\r\n5. if PlannedStartTime >= PlannedEndTime, if not error 11201 is returned;\r\n6. if the StateMachine exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n7. if the StateMachine has at least one Status, if not error 11320 is returned;\r\n8. if the StateMachine has an initial Status, if not the error 10984 is returned.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"2777"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Updates an Order.\r\nWhen the Order is updated, the command raises the OrderUpdated event.\r\nThe command checks the Order:\r\n1. if it exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n2. if the Quantity is not < 0, if so error 10849 is returned;\r\n3. if the UoM is defined but not the Quantity, if not error 10008 is returned;\r\n4. if the ActualStartTime >= ActualEndTime, if not error 10979 is returned;\r\n5. if PlannedStartTime >= PlannedEndTime, if not error 11201 is returned;\r\n6. if the StateMachine exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n7. if the StateMachine has at least one Status, if not error 11320 is returned;\r\n8. if the StateMachine has an initial Status, if not the error 10984 is returned.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Updates an Order.\r\nWhen the Order is updated, the command raises the OrderUpdated event.\r\nThe command checks the Order:\r\n1. if it exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n2. if the Quantity is not < 0, if so error 10849 is returned;\r\n3. if the UoM is defined but not the Quantity, if not error 10008 is returned;\r\n4. if the ActualStartTime >= ActualEndTime, if not error 10979 is returned;\r\n5. if PlannedStartTime >= PlannedEndTime, if not error 11201 is returned;\r\n6. if the StateMachine exists, if not error 10300 is returned;\r\n7. if the StateMachine has at least one Status, if not error 11320 is returned;\r\n8. if the StateMachine has an initial Status, if not the error 10984 is returned."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"2778","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"2466"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"2779","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(756982b4-ae7c-4678-b6dc-8b74dd03e61e)","FullInfo":"@Guid(756982b4-ae7c-4678-b6dc-8b74dd03e61e)","InfoMap":{"$id":"2780","FullIdObj":{"$id":"2781","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(756982b4-ae7c-4678-b6dc-8b74dd03e61e)","FullInfo":"@Guid(756982b4-ae7c-4678-b6dc-8b74dd03e61e)","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"2781"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"2466"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@Guid(756982b4-ae7c-4678-b6dc-8b74dd03e61e)","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@Guid(756982b4-ae7c-4678-b6dc-8b74dd03e61e)"}],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"UpdateOrder","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"UpdateOrder"},{"$id":"2782","$type":"DslCommandInputDeclarationTree","Children":[{"$id":"2783","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"WITH","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"2466"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"WITH","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"WITH"},{"$id":"2784","$type":"DslCommandPropertyCollectionTree","Name