 Operations to an Order.\r\nVerifies that the submitted Order exists in the database (according to the ID given as input) and that it is not frozen. If frozen, it raises the error 11202.\r\nIf the execution of the command AddOrderOperationsToOrder is successful, it raises an event OrderOperationsAddedToOrder when the new operation data is saved in the database.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"3091"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Adds one or more Operations to an Order.\r\nVerifies that the submitted Order exists in the database (according to the ID given as input) and that it is not frozen. If frozen, it raises the error 11202.\r\nIf the execution of the command AddOrderOperationsToOrder is successful, it raises an event OrderOperationsAddedToOrder when the new operation data is saved in the database.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Adds one or more Operations to an Order.\r\nVerifies that the submitted Order exists in the database (according to the ID given as input) and that it is not frozen. If frozen, it raises the error 11202.\r\nIf the execution of the command AddOrderOperationsToOrder is successful, it raises an event OrderOperationsAddedToOrder when the new operation data is saved in the database."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"3092","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"2466"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"3093","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(cc7e661e-e40a-4229-b978-3bb588e46de7)","FullInfo":"@Guid(cc7e661e-e40a-4229-b978-3bb588e46de7)","InfoMap":{"$id":"3094","FullIdObj":{"$id":"3095","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(cc7e661e-e40a-4229-b978-3bb588e46de7)","FullInfo":"@Guid(cc7e661e-e40a-4229-b978-3bb588e46de7)","TypeResolved":""}},"