e attribute IsFrozen to False. \r\nThe command verifies that an Order exists with the Id passed as argument. If not, it raises the error 10300.\r\nWhen the command is successful, it triggers the event OrderUnfrozen.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Configures the Order to be editable or allows its deletion by setting the attribute IsFrozen to False. \r\nThe command verifies that an Order exists with the Id passed as argument. If not, it raises the error 10300.\r\nWhen the command is successful, it triggers the event OrderUnfrozen."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"3368","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"2466"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"3369","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(437c5c68-ef97-49fc-9e50-b2d9e33fafb0)","FullInfo":"@Guid(437c5c68-ef97-49fc-9e50-b2d9e33fafb0)","InfoMap":{"$id":"3370","FullIdObj":{"$id":"3371","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(437c5c68-ef97-49fc-9e50-b2d9e33fafb0)","FullInfo":"@Guid(437c5c68-ef97-49fc-9e50-b2d9e33fafb0)","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"3371"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"2466"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@Guid(437c5c68-ef97-49fc-9e50-b2d9e33fafb0)","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@Guid(437c5c68-ef97-49fc-9e50-b2d9e33fafb0)"}],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"UnfreezeOrder","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"UnfreezeOrder"},{"$id":"3372","$type":"DslCommandInputDeclarationTree","Children":[{"$id":"3373","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"WITH","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"2466"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"WITH","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"WITH"},{"$id":"3374","$type":"DslCommandPropertyCollecti